{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Beaudoin et al.（2026），beta-burst entropy与FOG预测研究；Thenaisie et al.（既有四人FOG队列研究）\",\n      \"pmid\": \"36070366（Thenaisie）\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.64898/2026.08.13.744293（Beaudoin）\",\n      \"report_says\": \"Beaudoin等2026年的研究分析了4名患者，其beta-burst entropy研究与Thenaisie既有四人队列存在重复使用数据的情况。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"现有可访问的Beaudoin研究摘要仅能确认其分析了4名患者，并报告pre-freeze分类AUC为0.825、threshold分类AUC为0.858，没有证明这4名患者与Thenaisie研究中的患者是同一批人。Thenaisie原始研究共纳入18人，其中4人出现频繁FOG。两项研究均涉及4名FOG患者不足以证明队列重叠。报告将疑似数据重复描述为已经确认的事实，缺乏原文Methods、患者编号或数据来源等直接证据，需要进一步核实，不能据此认定存在重复队列。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3eebda3e-454c-4504-92b5-8657f9aec3a6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T124942341795Z", "elapsed_seconds": 20.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:50:03.192164+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1e250d8daa5b06a615b69e7f211be7449d0551a59237a2ec5269079e47cfb9ef", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4